rian " [:a {:href "/athletes/58591"} "László Klinga"] ", and Indian " [:a {:href "/athletes/58714"} "Prem Nath"] ". Yanagida and Sanders won their matches by falls, defeating Nath and Klinga respectively, which eliminated them, giving Yanagida the gold medal and Sanders the silver."] "\n\n" [:p {} "After the Olympics Sanders decided to vacation in Europe but seven weeks later he was killed in a car accident in Skopje, Yugoslavia (now Macedonia). Yanagida never competed again internationally. Klinga won the bronze medal in München, based on fewer bad points than Nath."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "213"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59121"} "Hideaki Yanagida"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "398"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60751"} "Rich Sanders"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "149"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58591"} "László Klinga"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}